--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.J6SegILPre10`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem J6Seg.PreT.scan_sp (s : IState HS) (v : Fin HS → ℤ) (c : Fin HS → List ℤ) {Cs : Fin HS}
